{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>And the chief of the sailors approached</b> — the chief, for the sailors are those who raise the ropes, the ropes of the mast. And Rabbi Moses said: from the root of תחבולות (stratagems)." "<b>What are you doing</b> — like: אבדו עשתונותיו (his counsels perished), and like it: עשתי עשר (eleven), because this number is it, just as שנים are reckonings, general and specific, and like it: אלהים יחשוב לי (Elohim will reckon for me)."], :book :jonah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Jonah -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=19&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:06:56.820361737Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}